# Cloud Functions database configuration.
# These params are read at deploy time from the environment (functions/.env
# or `firebase functions:config`). They default to the project's actual
# database names below, so this file is only needed if the layout changes.
#
# FIRESTORE_DB_DEV  defaults to "dev-db"
# FIRESTORE_DB_PROD defaults to "prod"
#
# Do NOT set a single FIRESTORE_DATABASE_ID — the project uses two databases
# and each audit trigger is pinned to one via these two params.
